        "message": "T-3088: Reuse prepared Navigator code for occupied drivers\n\nPrepare the registered Inspector module alongside eligible driver-card metadata.\nReuse that module when a visitor inspects a driver, avoiding a second cold import\nboundary. Preparation creates no panel or seen marker and preserves current UI\nownership. Keep import deduplication, later-choice ownership and failed-load retry.\n\nIntegrate DEV42 while retaining occupied transport, standing idles and prior\nloading/card fixes. Actual transport, driven-assembly, Navigator and native\nreport checks pass; publication checks qualify the exact staged tree. Keep the\nprevious phone-card timeout and native tail timeout as negative evidence.\n\nFull native preflight, new-source scene interaction and current-HEAD CI remain\nrequired before DEV merge. No broader photographic or gait completion is claimed.\n\nCheckpoint: owner-requested incremental feature branch; full preflight pending",
